WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
Far in the north, near
the source of the Jordan,

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.340
stands a city with a
shrine to the god Pan.

3
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.640
It also has a temple
honouring the Roman emperor.

4
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:14.590
Here, Jesus asks his disciples:
who do you say that I am?

5
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.470
Peter gets the answer right.

6
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.800
Moments later, Jesus tells
him: get behind me, Satan!

7
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.320
So what did Peter misunderstand?

8
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:28.180
In this mission, you'll see why this
moment is a turning point in Mark's Gospel.

9
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.500
Then you'll climb a high
mountain with Peter,

10
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.370
James and John, where
Moses and Elijah appear.

11
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:38.530
Your mission: find out what
Peter misunderstood about Jesus.
